1.14.0: the warehouse door - load any .cube in the browser

The staged catalog is a curated 75; the library on disk holds five
hundred. The page grows "or load .cube": pick any file from your own
data/luts (or anywhere), and the wasm engine renders it - the stem
still drives film-derived grain, choosing from the dropdown clears the
custom film, and nothing is hosted: the cube travels straight from the
person's disk into the sandbox. The full warehouse from any browser,
including machines that only have the cubes on a USB stick.

DOM suite asserts the control exists; the wasm suite renders through
arbitrary cube text with a grainy stem (the custom path exactly).
